s the game central and consolidates my pieces into a stable group. It avoids extending into the outer edges prematurely and restricts the opponent\'s ability to make damaging multiple-disc flips (unlike move F4, which exposes the diagonal to a strong C5 counter).\n\nAnswer: (D, 3)'}
